---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us | EverywhereJob">
  <style>
    .card { background: #18181b; border-radius: 6px; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1px solid #27272a; }
    h1 { font-size: 2rem; color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  </style>

  <div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>About EverywhereJob</h1>
      <p>The idea for EverywhereJob started after I relocated to Sweden to join Spotify. While the move itself was an incredible opportunity, the actual process of planning it was overwhelming.</p>
      
      <p>Through countless conversations with other expats, I realized we all shared the same frustrations. Finding reliable, up-to-date salary data, navigating complex and ever-changing visa requirements, and trying to get a realistic picture of the true cost of living in a new country meant digging through dozens of fragmented websites and outdated forums.</p>

      <p>I built this website to solve that problem. EverywhereJob is designed to be the tool I wish I had—a centralized, clear, and informative platform to help people compare countries and plan their international moves with confidence.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>